    {
     "srt": "1\n00:00:0,924 --> 00:00:3,109\nEste es el momento en el que todos\n\n2\n00:00:2,109 --> 00:00:3,109\n \n\n3\n00:00:2,144 --> 00:00:4,435\n deberíamos empezar a creer de nuevo.\n\n4\n00:00:3,435 --> 00:00:4,435\n \n\n5\n00:00:3,560 --> 00:00:5,840\n Ahora rumbo a la Luna.\n\n6\n00:00:4,840 --> 00:00:5,840\n \n\n7\n00:00:5,460 --> 00:00:8,315\n Estados Unidos regresa a la Luna para\n\n8\n00:00:7,315 --> 00:00:8,315\n \n\n9\n00:00:7,366 --> 00:00:9,620\n construir una base lunar.\n\n10\n00:00:8,620 --> 00:00:9,620\n \n\n11\n00:00:8,860 --> 00:00:11,740\n La NASA ha seleccionado a Blue Origin.\n\n12\n00:00:10,740 --> 00:00:11,740\n \n\n13\n00:00:11,019 --> 00:00:14,019\n Puesto de avanzada lunar Astrolabe.\n\n14\n00:00:13,019 --> 00:00:14,019\n \n\n",
